{"year":"2025","content":[{"type":"text","content_text":"The 31st edition, the last under the name Screen Actors Guild Awards, took place on February 23, 2025, at the Shrine Auditorium in Los Angeles, hosted by <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 40462, 'screen_type': person}\">Kristen Bell</a> and streamed live on <i>Netflix</i>. <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 974576, 'screen_type': movie}\">Conclave</a> (2024) won the cast award, and <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1190668, 'screen_type': person}\">Timothée Chalamet</a> was named best actor for his role as Bob Dylan in <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 661539, 'screen_type': movie}\">A Complete Unknown</a> (2024). <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 6352, 'screen_type': person}\">Jane Fonda</a> received the lifetime achievement award. <i>Television awards are not included.</i>"},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Best Picture","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":974576,"name":"Conclave","image_path":"/7pMyhSbULMkCCOQCInBYU34Qmf3.jpg","director":"Edward Berger","winner":true},{"type":"movie","id":1064213,"name":"Anora","image_path":"/v8Pq2MwPXWDCg1MF3UxNlBCkgDA.jpg","director":"Sean Baker","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":661539,"name":"A Complete Unknown","image_path":"/tXNPJ3XvF4RaEV66Qm9QO3pu3w7.jpg","director":"James Mangold","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":974950,"name":"Emilia Pérez","image_path":"/8ZOvbX3gCZZatUfaIZFFSAdiboW.jpg","director":"Jacques Audiard","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":402431,"name":"Wicked","image_path":"/qcaKkLwIXCAxJtpetVYHniCvLZj.jpg","director":"Jon M. Chu","winner":false}]},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Best Actress","nominee_list":[{"type":"person","id":3416,"name":"Demi Moore","image_path":"/wApParZYBDi4yxekjfxjKEifJYh.jpg","winner":true,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":933260,"name":"The Substance","image_path":"/vWeOgzlhnP1sS23H3rzctGHB9Nb.jpg","director":"Coralie Fargeat"}},{"type":"person","id":6736,"name":"Pamela Anderso